a:4:{s:8:"form_key";s:16:"83qfvGJhomwYDtvV";s:7:"product";a:58:{s:4:"name";s:68:"2005 Jeep Grand Cherokee 5.7L V8 Gas PCM / ECU / ECM Engine Computer";s:11:"description";s:1803:"We have a wide array of re-manufactured engine computers for all different models of Jeep, including the Jeep Cherokee, Jeep Commander, Jeep Compass, Jeep Grand Cherokee, Jeep Wrangler, and more. All of our PCM / ECU /ECMs, including those for the 2005 Jeep Grand Cherokee, are custom programmed and calibrated to fit your car at just a fraction of the price that the dealer would charge. 

We operate a completely turn-key business. This means we will send you a discounted, re-manufactured PCM / ECU / ECMs and you send us your old one - we will include a return shipping label with your order. Plus, all of our rebuilt automotive computers come fully equipped with a LIFETIME GUARANTEE, when you send us your old engine computer. 

You will then be expected to install your engine’s upgraded computer. Have no fear! Most of the automotive computers we sell are easily swappable. Installation should be as simple as plug and play and can be done by virtually anyone. 
Our technicians are highly trained and experienced to ensure that you will received the best quality computer available so that you can more accurately and efficiently manage your vehicle or truck’s systems, including engine systems and transmission. You can trust that the engine computer experts here at Solo Automotive Electronics will allow you to keep your Jeep Grand Cherokee up to date. 

Call us today, toll-free, on (888) 848-0144 or contact us online to get your order started for a re-manufactured engine computer for your 2005 Jeep Grand Cherokee 5.7L V8. We will ship your parts within 24-48 hours after your order has been processed. You have a shipping choice of: Free Ground Shipping, Next Day Air, 3rd or 2nd Day Service. Furthermore, we also offer international delivery for orders outside of the U.S. 
